author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Every declared provenance dimension records an explicit unavailable marker when the selected harness declares it and no value is observed, so absence of a key means only that the dimension was never declared; summarizeAgentModelProvenance, or a generalization of it, computes observed/unavailable/legacy coverage for every declared dimension rather than for model alone; A test asserts the invariant generically over AGENT_PROVENANCE_DIMENSIONS so adding a fourth dimension cannot reintroduce a model-only branch; The existing corpus is given a stated disposition: the 471 effort-bearing entries and the entries with no effort key are documented as pre-fix populations, since history is append-only and cannot be back-filled"
parent: pm-dj98
risk: medium
confidence: 98
resolution: "Persist and analyze observed, unavailable, and legacy provenance for every declared dimension."
expected_result: Every declared provenance dimension has a recoverable three-state history contract.
actual_result: "Model, effort, role, and topic now use one generic invariant; existing pre-fix streams remain identifiable as legacy."
